  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge for girls education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bridge for Girls Education program is aimed at improving access to education among girls in Ntchisi and Phalombe districts in Malawi. This is Done through the provision of comprehensive scholarship(Tuition, Boarding and school supplies). 

The program is implemented across 28 schools where an after school club called CHATS(Creating Healthy Approaches to success) is implemented. CHATS aims at improving the girls life skills and is peer led with support from a teacher (Faculty Advisor-FA).

The program also engages communities around the schools and parents and guardians of scholarship beneficiaries on their role in the education of the girls as well as safeguarding.</narrative>
  </description>
